description "Rebel Marksman

Units suited for long-range combat and ambush operations.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Jagged Knife (Purple Style Saber)
-- No Saber Defense/Blaster Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- 60 Damage, Cripples On Hit
- Recon DL-44 Blaster Pistol (2)
-- 5% Less Damage
-- 20% Slower RoF
-- 100% Faster Velocity

^3Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Sense Immunity (Passive)
- Mind Trick Resist (1)
- Dexterity (1)

^8Abilities:
- Dodge ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]"